{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, take and process it. If not, scan and move to location. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsTargetLocationReached    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = ProcessObjectTask    /> <Action ID = IsObjectFound    />\"",
